window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-074-f00dc22493ceaf2f.json"]={sha256:"f00dc22493ceaf2f961e801f3f3d15e1c51b9764b09ce883ec58223ff39ce43f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-8979d91463d9c2d6","url":"https://timesketch.org/guides/user/search-query-guide/","title":"Timesketch developer documentation","titleEn":"Timesketch developer documentation","publisher":"Timesketch","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-074","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-074","related":[{"id":"security-v27-075","referenceUrls":["https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/symbol-tables.html"],"title":"Volatility 3：符號有效性門檻與跨映像分析覆蓋","titleEn":"Volatility 3: symbol-validity gates and cross-image analysis coverage","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付search-spec.json、import-manifest.csv、unique-events.csv與counterexamples.md；接手者應重現70、110及60三個不同數字。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver search-spec.json, import-manifest.csv, unique-events.csv and counterexamples.md. The receiving analyst must reproduce the distinct totals of seventy, 110 and sixty without guessing the original interface state.","difference":"為每個合成映像保存雜湊、OS建置、符號包識別、相容性依據與外掛退出狀態；只有需求滿足且完成的項目可進入後續分析。","differenceEn":"For each synthetic image, record hash, OS build, symbol-package identity, compatibility evidence and plugin exit status. Only items with satisfied requirements and completed execution enter subsequent analytical comparisons.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Timesketch的儲存搜尋與時間線協助重現分析；來源重複匯入不會製造第二個現實事件，事件身份應由明確來源鍵建立。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A有40個命中事件，B有30個，其中10個與A同源；再匯入A副本40列。原始身份由source_id加record_offset組成。 原始命中列70，唯一事件40+30−10=60；加入A副本後110列但仍60個唯一事件。","Volatility 3依賴適當符號與記憶體層；符號存在不代表與映像相容，需求失敗屬未知結果，不應建立空的成功程序清單。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 10份合成映像中8份符號相容，其中7份外掛成功、1份讀取失敗；另外2份符號不符。所有建置與檔名皆為教學代號。 符號相容率8/10=80%，可分析覆蓋7/10=70%；相容且失敗的那份不能算成功，兩種比率不可互換。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Timesketch saved searches and timelines support reproducible analysis. Importing a source twice does not create another real-world event; define identity with explicit source keys rather than row position. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Timeline A has forty matching events; B has thirty, ten sharing identities with A. A duplicate import adds forty rows. Define original identity as source_id plus record_offset. The initial result has seventy rows and 40+30−10=60 unique events. Adding the duplicate A import increases rows to 110 while the unique-event total remains sixty.","Volatility 3 depends on suitable symbols and memory layers. A symbol file being present does not establish image compatibility; unmet requirements produce an unknown result rather than a successful empty process inventory. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Of ten synthetic images, eight have compatible symbols: seven plugins complete and one encounters a read failure. Two other images have incompatible symbols. Builds and filenames are original teaching identifiers. Symbol compatibility is 8/10=80%, but analyzable coverage is 7/10=70%. The compatible image with failed execution is not successful, and these two proportions cannot substitute for one another.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-084","referenceUrls":["https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/recovery/"],"title":"etcd 3.6：快照還原、revision跳躍與監看快取重建","titleEn":"etcd 3.6: restored snapshots, revision jumps and watch-cache rebuilding","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付search-spec.json、import-manifest.csv、unique-events.csv與counterexamples.md；接手者應重現70、110及60三個不同數字。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver search-spec.json, import-manifest.csv, unique-events.csv and counterexamples.md. The receiving analyst must reproduce the distinct totals of seventy, 110 and sixty without guessing the original interface state.","difference":"記錄快照revision、客戶端最高已見revision及規劃跳躍量；判斷新revision是否越過已知觀測，並規劃可驗證的快取重新列舉。","differenceEn":"Record snapshot revision, highest client-observed revision and the proposed bump. Determine whether the restored revision exceeds known observations, then specify a verifiable cache relist rather than assuming continuity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Timesketch的儲存搜尋與時間線協助重現分析；來源重複匯入不會製造第二個現實事件，事件身份應由明確來源鍵建立。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A有40個命中事件，B有30個，其中10個與A同源；再匯入A副本40列。原始身份由source_id加record_offset組成。 原始命中列70，唯一事件40+30−10=60；加入A副本後110列但仍60個唯一事件。","etcd 3.6復原文件討論revision bump與標記壓縮，供監看用戶重新同步；本課只算數值與客戶端狀態，不執行任何真實叢集還原。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 快照revision為1000，已知客戶端最高看到1800；計畫增加1000，新revision2000，預留相對已知最高值200。 新值1000+1000=2000；相對觀測邊界2000−1800=200。此餘裕不是對未知客戶端或未來寫入的保證。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Timesketch saved searches and timelines support reproducible analysis. Importing a source twice does not create another real-world event; define identity with explicit source keys rather than row position. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Timeline A has forty matching events; B has thirty, ten sharing identities with A. A duplicate import adds forty rows. Define original identity as source_id plus record_offset. The initial result has seventy rows and 40+30−10=60 unique events. Adding the duplicate A import increases rows to 110 while the unique-event total remains sixty.","etcd 3.6 recovery documentation discusses revision bumps and marking compaction so watch clients can resynchronize. The exercise computes values and client state only; it performs no restore against a real cluster. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The snapshot revision is 1000 and the highest known client observation 1800. A planned bump of 1000 yields revision 2000, leaving a margin of 200 above that known observation. The resulting revision is 1000+1000=2000, with margin 2000−1800=200. That margin is not a guarantee for unknown clients or future writes beyond the observed boundary.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-f7c2cb512e0ab948","url":"https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/symbol-tables.html","title":"Volatility 3 symbol tables","titleEn":"Volatility 3 symbol tables","publisher":"Volatility Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-6f994f12a0776fdc","url":"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/recovery/","title":"etcd 3.6 disaster recovery","titleEn":"etcd 3.6 disaster recovery","publisher":"etcd","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
